fixture dash_cancel_attack_survives_cling
doc BUILD.md s15 Combat, the dash cancel "never eats the next attack input" (movement review 5, H2). Air side 1 in tech 6's shaft, attack pressed on its frame 3, an air dash toward the wall on its frame 4: the dash meets the wall and clings before it allows a strike. The press waits the attack buffer from the cling and fires on the next frame, away from the wall. It used to be dropped with the dash.
room test/shaft
spawn 700 300
frames 40
input
  0 R
  1 R attack
  2 R
  3 R attack
  4 R dash
  5..39 R
end
expect
  at 1 event.attack=1 action=side1
  at 4 event.dash=1
  mark cling 4..20 event.wall_cling=1
  at cling+1 event.attack=1 action=side2 action_dir=-1
end
